    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d278">

                <pb facs="0385" n="265" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg265"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Squiers to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-01-14"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 14,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>House agrees Senate sanitation bill reported by telegram of December 17<anchor
                        n="a" xml:id="d278-f1"/> and President approves to-day. Secretary of Public
                    Works Diaz goes to Santiago immediately to superintend work of sanitation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Squiers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
